Here is a self-contained HTML file that recreates the classic 1978 Taito arcade game "Astrans" (a fictional name for this replication) as a single-page web experience. It includes inline CSS and JS, with pixel-perfect sprite designs and authentic arcade mechanics.
```html
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>1978 Taito Arcade: Astrans</title>
    <style>
        * {
            box-sizing: border-box;
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
        }
        body {
            background: #111;
            display: flex;
            justify-content: center;
            align-items: center;
            min-height: 100vh;
            font-family: 'Courier New', monospace;
        }
        .cabinet {
            background: #222;
            border: 6px solid #5a3e1b;
            border-radius: 20px 20px 10px 10px;
            padding: 20px 30px;
            box-shadow: 0 0 30px rgba(0,0,0,0.8), inset 0 0 20px #000;
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            align-items: center;
        }
        .marquee {
            background: #000;
            color: #f0f0ff;
            font-size: 1.8rem;
            font-weight: bold;
            letter-spacing: 6px;
            text-shadow: 0 0 10px #7af, 0 0 20px #3af;
            padding: 10px 30px;
            border: 2px solid #f0d060;
            border-radius: 8px;
            margin-bottom: 12px;
            text-align: center;
            width: 100%;
        }
        .screen-wrapper {
            background: #000;
            border: 4px solid #333;
            border-radius: 10px;
            padding: 10px;
            margin: 5px 0;
        }
        canvas {
            display: block;
            background: #0a0a0a;
            width: 640px;
            height: 480px;
            image-rendering: pixelated;
            box-shadow: inset 0 0 20px #1a1a1a;
        }
        .controls {
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
            width: 100%;
            margin-top: 15px;
            gap: 20px;
        }
        .btn-group {
            display: flex;
            gap: 20px;
        }
        .arcade-btn {
            background: #d32f2f;
            border: 3px solid #b71c1c;
            border-radius: 50%;
            width: 55px;
            height: 55px;
            color: #fff;
            font-weight: bold;
            font-size: 1.2rem;
            box-shadow: 0 4px 0 #7f0000, 0 6px 10px rgba(0,0,0,0.6);
            cursor: pointer;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            transition: 0.05s;
        }
        .arcade-btn:active {
            transform: translateY(4px);
            box-shadow: 0 2px 0 #7f0000;
        }
        .arcade-btn.start {
            background: #2e7d32;
            border-color: #1b5e20;
            box-shadow: 0 4px 0 #1b5e20;
        }
        .arcade-btn.start:active { box-shadow: 0 2px 0 #1b5e20; }
        .info-panel {
            color: #ddd;
            font-size: 0.9rem;
            background: #1a1a1a;
            padding: 6px 12px;
            border-radius: 12px;
            border: 2px solid #444;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 20px;
        }
        .info-panel span {
            background: #000;
            padding: 2px 10px;
            border-radius: 6px;
            color: #f0f060;
        }
        .footer {
            color: #666;
            font-size: 0.7rem;
            margin-top: 10px;
            text-align: center;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
<div class="cabinet">
    <div class="marquee">★ ASTRANS ★</div>
    <div class="screen-wrapper">
        <canvas id="gameCanvas" width="640" height="480"></canvas>
    </div>
    <div class="controls">
        <div class="btn-group">
            <button class="arcade-btn" id="btnLeft">←</button>
            <button class="arcade-btn" id="btnRight">→</button>
            <button class="arcade-btn" id="btnFire">⚡</button>
        </div>
        <div class="info-panel">
            <span id="scoreDisplay">0000</span>
            <span id="livesDisplay">♥♥♥</span>
        </div>
        <button class="arcade-btn start" id="btnStart">▶</button>
    </div>
    <div class="footer">1978 Taito · 1 or 2 players · insert coin</div>
</div>
<script>
    (function() {
        // ---------- ARCADE KERNEL ----------
        const canvas = document.getElementById('gameCanvas');
        const ctx = canvas.getContext('2d');
        const scoreSpan = document.getElementById('scoreDisplay');
        const livesSpan = document.getElementById('livesDisplay');

        // buttons
        const btnLeft = document.getElementById('btnLeft');
        const btnRight = document.getElementById('btnRight');
        const btnFire = document.getElementById('btnFire');
        const btnStart = document.getElementById('btnStart');

        // ---------- GAME STATE ----------
        const PLAYER_W = 28, PLAYER_H = 20;   // hitbox slightly smaller than sprite
        const INVADER_W = 28, INVADER_H = 20;
        const INVADER_ROWS = 5;
        const INVADERS_PER_ROW = 10;
        const BOMB_W = 8, BOMB_H = 12;
        const PLAYER_BULLET_W = 4, PLAYER_BULLET_H = 12;

        let gameRunning = false;
        let score = 0;
        let lives = 3;
        let level = 1;

        // player
        let playerX = 320 - PLAYER_W/2;
        const playerY = 440;
        let playerSpeed = 5;

        // invaders
        let invaders = [];
        let invaderDirection = 1; // 1 right, -1 left
        let invaderStep = 0;
        const INVADER_BASE_SPEED = 20;
        let invaderMoveCounter = 0;
        let invaderMoveDelay = 12; // frames per step
        let invaderMoveFrame = 0;

        // bullets
        let playerBullets = [];
        let enemyBullets = [];
        const BULLET_SPEED = 7;
        const ENEMY_BULLET_SPEED = 4;

        // sprites (pixel art)
        const PLAYER_SPRITE = [
            "·8888·",
            "888888",
            "8·88·8",
            "8·88·8",
            "888888",
            "·8··8·",
            "·8··8·"
        ];
        const INVADER_SPRITE_1 = [
            "··888·",
            "·8888·",
            "888888",
            "8·88·8",
            "888888",
            "·8··8·",
            "··88··"
        ];
        const INVADER_SPRITE_2 = [
            "·888··",
            "·8888·",
            "888888",
            "8·88·8",
            "888888",
            "·8··8·",
            "··88··"
        ];
        // bomb sprite
        const BOMB_SPRITE = [
            "··88··",
            "·8888·",
            "888888",
            "·8888·",
            "··88··"
        ];

        // ---------- HELPERS ----------
        function drawSprite(sprite, x, y, w, h, color1='#7df', color2='#fff') {
            const rows = sprite.length;
            const cols = sprite[0].length;
            const cellW = w / cols;
            const cellH = h / rows;
            for (let r = 0; r < rows; r++) {
                for (let c = 0; c < cols; c++) {
                    const ch = sprite[r][c];
                    if (ch === '8') {
                        ctx.fillStyle = (r%2===0 && c%2===0) ? color1 : color2;
                        ctx.fillRect(x + c*cellW, y + r*cellH, cellW, cellH);
                    } else if (ch === '·') {
                        // empty
                    }
                }
            }
        }

        // ---------- INIT / RESET ----------
        function resetGame() {
            score = 0;
            lives = 3;
            level = 1;
            gameRunning = true;
            initLevel();
            updateUI();
        }

        function initLevel() {
            invaders = [];
            const startX = 30;
            const startY = 40;
            for (let row = 0; row < INVADER_ROWS; row++) {
                for (let col = 0; col < INVADERS_PER_ROW; col++) {
                    invaders.push({
                        x: startX + col * 55,
                        y: startY + row * 45,
                        alive: true,
                        frame: 0
                    });
                }
            }
            invaderDirection = 1;
            invaderMoveFrame = 0;
            invaderMoveDelay = Math.max(6, 12 - level * 1);
            playerBullets = [];
            enemyBullets = [];
            playerX = 320 - PLAYER_W/2;
        }

        // ---------- UPDATE ----------
        function update() {
            if (!gameRunning) return;

            // move invaders
            invaderMoveFrame++;
            if (invaderMoveFrame >= invaderMoveDelay) {
                invaderMoveFrame = 0;
                let shift = invaderDirection * 12;
                let edgeReach = false;
                for (let inv of invaders) {
                    if (!inv.alive) continue;
                    if (inv.x + shift <= 0 || inv.x + INVADER_W + shift >= 640) {
                        edgeReach = true;
                        break;
                    }
                }
                if (edgeReach) {
                    invaderDirection *= -1;
                    for (let inv of invaders) {
                        if (!inv.alive) continue;
                        inv.y += 10;
                    }
                } else {
                    for (let inv of invaders) {
                        if (!inv.alive) continue;
                        inv.x += shift;
                    }
                }
                // toggle frame
                for (let inv of invaders) {
                    if (!inv.alive) continue;
                    inv.frame = (inv.frame + 1) % 2;
                }
            }

            // enemy fire
            if (Math.random() < 0.02 * (level * 0.5 + 0.5)) {
                let aliveInvaders = invaders.filter(i => i.alive);
                if (aliveInvaders.length > 0) {
                    let idx = Math.floor(Math.random() * aliveInvaders.length);
                    let src = aliveInvaders[idx];
                    enemyBullets.push({
                        x: src.x + INVADER_W/2 - BOMB_W/2,
                        y: src.y + INVADER_H,
                        w: BOMB_W, h: BOMB_H
                    });
                }
            }

            // move enemy bullets
            for (let i = 0; i < enemyBullets.length; i++) {
                let b = enemyBullets[i];
                b.y += ENEMY_BULLET_SPEED;
                if (b.y > 480) { enemyBullets.splice(i, 1); i--; continue; }
                // collision with player
                if (b.x < playerX + PLAYER_W && b.x + BOMB_W > playerX &&
                    b.y < playerY + PLAYER_H && b.y + BOMB_H > playerY) {
                    // hit player
                    lives--;
                    enemyBullets.splice(i, 1);
                    i--;
                    if (lives <= 0) {
                        gameRunning = false;
                        updateUI();
                        break;
                    }
                    updateUI();
                    continue;
                }
            }

            // move player bullets
            for (let i = 0; i < playerBullets.length; i++) {
                let b = playerBullets[i];
                b.y -= BULLET_SPEED;
                if (b.y < 0) { playerBullets.splice(i, 1); i--; continue; }
                // collision with invaders
                for (let inv of invaders) {
                    if (!inv.alive) continue;
                    if (b.x < inv.x + INVADER_W && b.x + PLAYER_BULLET_W > inv.x &&
                        b.y < inv.y + INVADER_H && b.y + PLAYER_BULLET_H > inv.y) {
                        inv.alive = false;
                        playerBullets.splice(i, 1);
                        i--;
                        score += 10 * level;
                        updateUI();
                        break;
                    }
                }
            }

            // check win
            if (invaders.every(inv => !inv.alive)) {
                level++;
                initLevel();
                updateUI();
            }

            // player movement (keyboard / buttons handled via events)
        }

        // ---------- DRAW ----------
        function draw() {
            ctx.clearRect(0, 0, 640, 480);

            // background grid
            ctx.fillStyle = '#0a0a0a';
            ctx.fillRect(0,0,640,480);
            for (let i=0; i<640; i+=40) {
                ctx.strokeStyle = '#1a1a1a';
                ctx.lineWidth = 1;
                ctx.beginPath();
                ctx.moveTo(i,0);
                ctx.lineTo(i,480);
                ctx.stroke();
                ctx.beginPath();
                ctx.moveTo(0,i);
                ctx.lineTo(640,i);
                ctx.stroke();
            }

            // draw invaders
            for (let inv of invaders) {
                if (!inv.alive) continue;
                let sprite = (inv.frame === 0) ? INVADER_SPRITE_1 : INVADER_SPRITE_2;
                drawSprite(sprite, inv.x, inv.y, INVADER_W, INVADER_H, '#e04040', '#ff6060');
            }

            // draw enemy bullets (bombs)
            for (let b of enemyBullets) {
                drawSprite(BOMB_SPRITE, b.x, b.y, BOMB_W, BOMB_H, '#ff4', '#fa0');
            }

            // draw player
            drawSprite(PLAYER_SPRITE, playerX, playerY, PLAYER_W, PLAYER_H, '#4af', '#8cf');

            // draw player bullets
            for (let b of playerBullets) {
                ctx.fillStyle = '#fff';
                ctx.shadowColor = '#7af';
                ctx.shadowBlur = 10;
                ctx.fillRect(b.x, b.y, PLAYER_BULLET_W, PLAYER_BULLET_H);
                ctx.shadowBlur = 0;
            }

            // game over overlay
            if (!gameRunning && lives <= 0) {
                ctx.fillStyle = '#000';
                ctx.globalAlpha = 0.7;
                ctx.fillRect(0, 200, 640, 80);
                ctx.globalAlpha = 1;
                ctx.fillStyle = '#f22';
                ctx.font = 'bold 36px "Courier New", monospace';
                ctx.textAlign = 'center';
                ctx.fillText('GAME OVER', 320, 260);
                ctx.font = '18px monospace';
                ctx.fillStyle = '#ffa';
                ctx.fillText('PRESS START', 320, 300);
            } else if (!gameRunning && lives > 0) {
                ctx.fillStyle = '#000';
                ctx.globalAlpha = 0.5;
                ctx.fillRect(0, 200, 640, 60);
                ctx.globalAlpha = 1;
                ctx.fillStyle = '#0af';
                ctx.font = 'bold 28px "Courier New", monospace';
                ctx.textAlign = 'center';
                ctx.fillText('INSERT COIN', 320, 250);
            }
        }

        // ---------- UI UPDATE ----------
        function updateUI() {
            scoreSpan.textContent = String(score).padStart(4, '0');
            let hearts = '';
            for (let i=0; i<lives; i++) hearts += '♥';
            livesSpan.textContent = hearts || '💀';
        }

        // ---------- INPUT ----------
        let keys = { left: false, right: false, fire: false };

        function handleKeyDown(e) {
            if (!gameRunning) return;
            const key = e.key;
            if (key === 'ArrowLeft' || key === 'a') keys.left = true;
            if (key === 'ArrowRight' || key === 'd') keys.right = true;
            if (key === ' ' || key === 'z' || key === 'x') {
                if (!keys.fire) {
                    keys.fire = true;
                    fireBullet();
                }
            }
            e.preventDefault();
        }

        function handleKeyUp(e) {
            const key = e.key;
            if (key === 'ArrowLeft' || key === 'a') keys.left = false;
            if (key === 'ArrowRight' || key === 'd') keys.right = false;
            if (key === ' ' || key === 'z' || key === 'x') keys.fire = false;
            e.preventDefault();
        }

        function fireBullet() {
            if (!gameRunning) return;
            if (playerBullets.length >= 2) return; // max 2 on screen
            playerBullets.push({
                x: playerX + PLAYER_W/2 - PLAYER_BULLET_W/2,
                y: playerY - 10,
                w: PLAYER_BULLET_W, h: PLAYER_BULLET_H
            });
        }

        // button events
        btnLeft.addEventListener('mousedown', (e) => { e.preventDefault(); keys.left = true; });
        btnLeft.addEventListener('mouseup', (e) => { e.preventDefault(); keys.left = false; });
        btnLeft.addEventListener('touchstart', (e) => { e.preventDefault(); keys.left = true; });
        btnLeft.addEventListener('touchend', (e) => { e.preventDefault(); keys.left = false; });

        btnRight.addEventListener('mousedown', (e) => { e.preventDefault(); keys.right = true; });
        btnRight.addEventListener('mouseup', (e) => { e.preventDefault(); keys.right = false; });
        btnRight.addEventListener('touchstart', (e) => { e.preventDefault(); keys.right = true; });
        btnRight.addEventListener('touchend', (e) => { e.preventDefault(); keys.right = false; });

        btnFire.addEventListener('mousedown', (e) => { e.preventDefault(); if (!keys.fire) { keys.fire = true; fireBullet(); } });
        btnFire.addEventListener('mouseup', (e) => { e.preventDefault(); keys.fire = false; });
        btnFire.addEventListener('touchstart', (e) => { e.preventDefault(); if (!keys.fire) { keys.fire = true; fireBullet(); } });
        btnFire.addEventListener('touchend', (e) => { e.preventDefault(); keys.fire = false; });

        btnStart.addEventListener('click', (e) => {
            e.preventDefault();
            resetGame();
        });

        window.addEventListener('keydown', handleKeyDown);
        window.addEventListener('keyup', handleKeyUp);

        // ---------- GAME LOOP ----------
        function gameLoop() {
            if (gameRunning) {
                // move player
                if (keys.left) playerX -= playerSpeed;
                if (keys.right) playerX += playerSpeed;
                playerX = Math.max(0, Math.min(640 - PLAYER_W, playerX));

                update();
                // enemy fire can also happen in update
            }
            draw();
            requestAnimationFrame(gameLoop);
        }

        // start loop
        gameLoop();

        // initial state (waiting)
        gameRunning = false;
        lives = 3;
        score = 0;
        initLevel();
        updateUI();
        // draw demo invaders
        // but we need to show something
        // force draw
        setTimeout(() => { draw(); }, 50);

        // additional cleanup for mobile
        console.log('Astrans 1978 Taito Arcade');
    })();
</script>
</body>
</html>
```
### Gameplay & Design Overview
This page captures the look and feel of a classic 1978 arcade cabinet. Here's how it works:

- **Core Mechanics**: You control a player ship at the bottom, moving left and right to avoid enemy bombs and shoot at the invading aliens. The invaders move in a wave pattern, dropping bombs at random intervals.
- **Controls & Feedback**: Use the on-screen buttons or your keyboard (arrow keys to move, space/Z/X to fire). The score and lives display update in real-time, and the game ends when you lose all lives.
- **Visual & Audio Cues**: The pixel-art sprites and grid background recreate the original's aesthetic. The marquee and button styles mimic the arcade cabinet's physical interface.

The code is structured to be self-contained, with all styling and logic inline for a single-file arcade experience.
